  "description": "<p>This task is to review the existing Fedora blank node documentation, and supplement it where it is lacking.</p>\n\n<p>Some starting points:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/dosearchsite.action?queryString=bnode&amp;startIndex=0&amp;where=FF\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/dosearchsite.action?queryString=bnode&amp;startIndex=0&amp;where=FF</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/dosearchsite.action?queryString=blank%20node&amp;startIndex=0&amp;where=FF\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/dosearchsite.action?queryString=blank%20node&amp;startIndex=0&amp;where=FF</a></p>\n\n<p>Also, here is a brief collection of notes on ordering that Stefano started a little while ago:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FF/Design+-+Ordered+Lists\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FF/Design+-+Ordered+Lists</a></p>",
